<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 3.0 bln skr in 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 3.0 bln skr in 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of three billion crowns of 10-year bonds. Bids have to be entered by 1130 GMT on October 30.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p> Auction date			     October 30, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date			    October 25, 2006</p>
<p> Coupon  (pct)			    6.5</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)    3.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			  November 4, 1996</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
